// UPDATE 2026-07-21: v-core-opt landed 4450cc8ed (option C, concierge-ruled) — an ACTIONABLE DIAGNOSTIC
// for this reject: the cryptic CDZ0201 'depends on runtime data' is replaced with a hint (keep the enclosing
// fn polymorphic — drop the intermediate `it: Iter` annotation — or inline the forwarding). The REJECT STAYS
// (zero behavior change); 09-functions:316 remains `todo` on all 3. The real fix (backward const-propagation)
